Collect all asset paths used by the given scene files.
@param scenePaths  Absolute paths to .mdfscene files
@param assetsRoot  Root Assets/ directory (for resolving relative paths)
@param registry    Asset registry (for UUID→path resolution)
@param outUnresolved  Optional: every reference that resolved to nothing
@return Set of absolute file paths that should be packed

Alpha-test threshold whose pass fraction every mip keeps; 0 = off
(MtexBuildOptions::alphaCoverageCutoff). The editor offers the presets;
0.5 is the material default cutoff.
